      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Output device picker in Settings &gt; Audio — choose your DAC without touching System Settings; the choice is applied on launch and takes effect from the next track.</li>
